      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Margins",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>And to my wife I leave 30 dinars. It should be paid to her. And Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r al-Kohen al-\u1e62ayraf\u012b owes me 750 dirhams and with those my debts should be paid.&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
